{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18510","headline":"元日陪早朝 · 欧阳詹","name":"元日陪早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斗柄东回岁又新，邃旒南面挹来宾。\n和光髣髴楼台晓，休气氛氲天地春。\n仪龠不唯丹穴鸟，称觞半是越裳人。\n江臯腐草今何幸，亦与恒星拱北辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}